  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup almond flour",
    "3 tablespoon unflavored low-carb protein powder",
    "2 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "2 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "8 tablespoon butter (room temp)",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "10 drop liquid stevia",
    "1 large egg",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "50 gram low-carb dark chocolate (like chocoperfection)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350F. Then, mix together almond flour, unflavored whey protein, coconut flour, psyllium husk powder and baking powder.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6349.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a hand mixer, beat room temperature butter to a pale color. This should take about 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6351.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add erythritol and liquid stevia to the butter and beat again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6356.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add egg and vanilla extract to the beaten butter and beat again until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6363.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift dry ingredients over butter and mix again to combine fully. Make sure there are no lumps when you finish.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6369.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop the Chocoperfection (or other 95%+ chocolate bar) and add to the dough. Mix together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6377.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the dough into a log. Make small markings over the top of the log to ensure consistent measurements of cookies.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6384.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice off each piece of dough and roll into a ball. Lay each ball onto a silpat that is on a baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6397.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the bottom of a mason jar, lightly press the cookies flat into circles.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6402.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake the cookies for 12-15 minutes or until a light golden brown color appears on the edges.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6413.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool for 5-10 minutes before removing from the baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG_6414.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up with a nice glass of coconut or almond milk, and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chunk-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51201-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
